---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/aman-portrait.jpg";
---
<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="shell section-layout">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="index">04 //</span> About</p><h2>Background & approach.</h2></div>
    <div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Portrait of Aman Krishna Thakur" widths={[240, 480]} sizes="170px" width={240} height={275} class="portrait" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="copy">
          <p>I graduated from Chandigarh University in June 2024 with a B.Sc. in Computer Science, Statistics and Mathematics.</p>
          <p>Today, I develop production software at Complyr. I'm interested in building useful products and continuing to grow across the stack.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow"><h3>How I work</h3><p class="copy">I use AI coding tools to explore codebases, support implementation, and debug changes. I review and validate generated code, and take responsibility for what I ship.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
